    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > User Manual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before using the product, please read this manual carefully and keep it safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Product Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404380/extras/3438f581a1ae728be8a12040ae4bbfc2.avif?t=1739088353\" width=350 height=476 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404380/extras/3264cddfd98b949bb4bad3d8d601b877.avif?t=1739088353\" width=800 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><br>The product shown in the manual is for illustrative purposes only. Due to product updates and upgrades, the actual product may differ slightly from the image. Please refer to the actual product for confirmation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shutdown</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-clicking on the character's body will display the &quot;QUIT&quot; button, and you can use the mouse wheel to zoom in or out. Right-clicking again will hide the &quot;QUIT&quot; button.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking the &quot;QUIT&quot; button will exit the product.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gaze Tracking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the application is running, the product's gaze will follow your actions and track the movement of your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The product can be freely dragged and moved.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > User Manual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before using the product, please read this manual carefully and keep it safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Product Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404380/extras/3438f581a1ae728be8a12040ae4bbfc2.avif?t=1739088353\" width=350 height=476 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404380/extras/3264cddfd98b949bb4bad3d8d601b877.avif?t=1739088353\" width=800 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><br>The product shown in the manual is for illustrative purposes only. Due to product updates and upgrades, the actual product may differ slightly from the image. Please refer to the actual product for confirmation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shutdown</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-clicking on the character's body will display the &quot;QUIT&quot; button, and you can use the mouse wheel to zoom in or out. Right-clicking again will hide the &quot;QUIT&quot; button.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking the &quot;QUIT&quot; button will exit the product.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gaze Tracking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the application is running, the product's gaze will follow your actions and track the movement of your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The product can be freely dragged and moved.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2>",
